nders Wang","role":"Policeman Norway"},{"id":2481912,"name":"Ragna Schwenke","role":"Sleeping woman"},{"id":3428141,"name":"Geir Gulbrandsen","role":"Prosecutor"},{"id":3306411,"name":"Lasse Boberg","role":"Helicopter pilot"},{"id":3114276,"name":"Pascal Duthuin","role":"Poacher","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fswpr2zI0orMAXLnBYfTJeHmMgO.jpg"},{"id":3428164,"name":"Robin Edward Johannessen","role":"Police officer"},{"id":1851086,"name":"Jørn Magnus Karlsen","role":"Danish fisherman"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Sulle ali dell'avventura","overview":"Christian si è separato da Paola e si è trasferito lontano dalla città, in Camargue, dove ha elaborato un piano, al limite della legalità, per salvare le oche selvagge dall'estinzione. A bordo del suo ultraleggero vorrebbe indicare loro una rotta migratoria alternativa, che le porti sane e salve dalla Norvegia fino a casa, nel sud della Francia, preservandole dallo scontro mortale con cavi elettrici, carenza di cibo, aeroporti, inquinamento luminoso e bracconaggio. Suo figlio adolescente Thomas, costretto a passare le vacanze col padre, lontano dai videogiochi, si scoprirà pian piano altrettanto appassionato al progetto e diventerà il protagonista di un'avventura incredibile, nei cieli d'Europa."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Spread Your Wings","overview":"Christian, a visionary scientist, studies wild geese. For his son, a teenager obsessed with video games, the idea of spending a holiday with his father in the wilderness is a nightmare. However, father and son will get together around a crazy project: save a species endangered, thanks to the ultralight of Christian! Then begins an incredible and perilous journey ..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Christian, divorcé, scientifique visionnaire, étudie les oies sauvages. Pour son fils, adolescent obnubilé par les jeux vidéos et la culture à fabriquer des crétins, vivant avec sa mère, l’idée de passer des vacances avec son père dans les marées de la Camargue, en pleine nature, est un cauchemar. Pourtant, père et fils vont se rapprocher autour d’un projet fou : sauver une espèce en voie de disparition, en ouvrant une nouvelle route pour leur migration vers le nord, en les préservant de toutes les prédations humaines et technologiques ! Commence alors un incroyable et incertain voyage...","tagline":"« Nous n'héritons pas de la terre de nos ancêtres, nous l'empruntons à nos enfants. »"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gO0WUpxUcUVaQT0Iu7ynnwW7Lyt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A9Ub7OXDS0OuEP2DelhYJM8yvrO.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"fr-FR","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y6GqD6MabPjvPrJeTmRmgd896Py.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y6GqD6MabPjvPrJeTmRmgd896Py.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8V9IRSsoGbKoHVuE36T4hACVCzt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8V9IRSsoGbKoHVuE36T4hACVCzt.jpg","language":"fr","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hoyRctEni5emVYbRO4q2vB7dMEB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hoyRctEni5emVYbRO4q2vB7dMEB.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDRV38Fhh0OJzmYkdBaCSRnbDWm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qDRV38Fhh0OJzmYkdBaCSRnbDWm.jpg","language":"en","width":1270,"height":1776},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gjhH0QCizOqB3u7ZnGwXlGC2lgA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gjhH0QCizOqB3u7ZnGwXlGC2lgA.jpg","language":"fr","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1dvia1i3tc8DvfyecLBduMh424Z.jpg